      "text": "will make him an help meet for him, Gen. 2:18 (Moses 3:18; Abr. 5:14). Moses stood up and helped them, Ex. 2:17. him that hateth thee … thou shalt surely help with him, Ex. 23:5. thou shalt surely help him to lift them up, Deut. 22:4. saved by the Lord, the shield of thy help, Deut. 33:29. prophets of God helping them, Ezra 5:2. Lord: he is our help and our shield, Ps. 33:20. a very present help in trouble, Ps. 46:1. Give us help from trouble: for vain is the help of man, Ps. 60:11 (108:12). unto the hills, from whence cometh my help, Ps. 121:1. My help cometh from the Lord, Ps. 121:2. Our help is in the name of the Lord, Ps. 124:8.",
